        "title": "Casting",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "1. PATTERN CREATION\n   Permanent pattern (wood, plastic, aluminum) dimensioned with:\n   • Draft angle (1–3°): enables withdrawal from sand without collapsing\n   • Machining allowance: extra material where precision surfaces needed\n   • Shrinkage allowance: pattern is larger than desired casting\n     (Al shrinks ~1.3%, steel ~2%)"
    },
